<main class="mso-main">
  <header class="mso-document-heading"><div><p class="mso-eyebrow">REUSABLE CHARACTER DESIGNS</p><h2>Widget Preset Manager</h2></div><button type="button" class="mso-primary" data-action="createWidgetPreset">Create widget preset</button></header>
  <p class="mso-help">Design once, then use Add widget in an overlay to assign a different character to each instance. Editing a shared design updates linked instances. Preview values use safe placeholders until a character is selected in the designer.</p>
  <section class="mso-widget-gallery" aria-label="Widget preset library">
    {{#each presets}}<article class="mso-panel mso-widget-card"><h3>{{name}}</h3><div class="mso-widget-library-preview" data-widget-preview="{{id}}" aria-label="Preview of {{name}}"></div><div class="mso-actions"><button type="button" data-widget-command="edit" data-preset-id="{{id}}">Edit / preview</button><button type="button" data-widget-command="rename" data-preset-id="{{id}}">Rename</button><button type="button" data-widget-command="duplicate" data-preset-id="{{id}}">Duplicate</button><button type="button" class="mso-danger" data-widget-command="delete" data-preset-id="{{id}}">Delete</button></div></article>{{else}}<p>Create a widget preset to start a reusable character design.</p>{{/each}}
  </section>
  <footer class="mso-save-bar"><p class="mso-help">The available character fields depend on the active game system. Generic portrait and name fields work in every system.</p><button type="button" data-action="fieldMappings">Advanced field mappings</button></footer>
</main>
